* text=auto eol=lf

# --- 归一化说明 ---
# 原 LumiLuna 项目工作区是 CRLF（core.autocrlf=true）而 prettier 配置 endOfLine: lf，
# 导致本地 `prettier --check` / `eslint .` 出现全量假阳性（改没改过的文件都报）。
# 本项目在初始化时统一声明 eol=lf，工作区与索引都是 LF，本地检查结果与 CI 一致。

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.epub binary
*.zip binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
